; multimaterial_purging = 140
; notes = EXPERIMENTAL. Prusa XL IS 0.4 print family (SPEED / STRUCTURAL / DETAIL / DRAFT). Motion clipped to Raise3D Pro2 Hyper FFF L1: 150 mm/s, 5000 mm/s2, 15 mm3/s. Travel 150 mm/s (ideaMaker / machine_max_feedrate). Accel follows ideaMaker Multicolor: print 2000, travel/first-layer 5000. PrusaSlicer still writes M204 S; run ensure_m99123_first.py to emit SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT and insert next-tool M104 preheat. Do not use XL 170/200/400. Wipe tower matches XL IS geometry (25 deg cone, 3 mm brim, 150% purge spacing); default position X50 Y140 so T1 can reach it (leftmost ~25 mm is T1 keep-out). Prime-all-extruders off (not MMU). Supports use the current extruder so the tower stays enabled.
