; toolchange_gcode = ; Raise3D electronic lift: firmware raises the unused nozzle. Do not emit M218.\n; Standby 180 C from ideaMaker MulticolorRaise3d.gcode. Do not hardcode wipe-tower XY — PrusaSlicer places the tower.\n; previous_extruder is -1 on the first change.\n; Mid-print next-tool M104 is inserted by ensure_m99123_first.py (next_extruder is not available in layer G-code).\n{if previous_extruder == 0}\nM104 T0 S180\n{elsif previous_extruder == 1}\nM104 T1 S180\n{endif}\nM109 T{next_extruder} S{temperature[next_extruder]}
